#X text 180 150 beat = the 1-based step the sequence has just reached \, numbered as seqstep is. A step plays its lock only if a value was recorded there (not -1) and its mask is on. Steps without a lock send nothing \, so the parameter holds. The has-locks gate keeps the per-step table reads away from the parameters that hold no lock at all \, which is nearly all of them.;
